*num* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''num(value)''

Converts a value to number.

*Parameters:*
- ''value'': Value to convert

*Returns:*
- Number: Converted value
  - Number: Returns copy of original
  - String: Parses as floating point number
  - List: Returns 0 for empty list, single number element if list has one number

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if string cannot be parsed as number
- Runtime error if list cannot be converted to number
- Runtime error if value type cannot be converted
